        "code": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## DynamoDB Capstone — Four-Table ThermoFleet Workload\n\nFour DynamoDB tables with realistic traffic shapes, polar-vortex burst, and auto-scaling:\n\n| Table | Billing | TTL | Auto-Scale | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **device-registry** | On-Demand | No | N/A | Low writes, moderate reads |\n| **device-telemetry** | Provisioned | 720 ticks | Yes | High writes, 5× polar-vortex burst (ticks 600–700) |\n| **device-commands** | On-Demand | No | N/A | Low volume, strong consistency |\n| **device-alerts** | On-Demand | No | N/A | Alert storms, 3× polar-vortex |\n\nBatch: `${batch_id}` · Scenario: `${scenarioId}` · Trials: `${trialCount}` · Ticks: `${simulationTicks}` · Window: `${windowSizeSeconds}` s",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.4.2",
      "targets": [],
      "title": "Demo Overview",
      "type": "text"
    },
